{"t":"Ornate Canopic Jar","s":"ornate-canopic-jar-fb281","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Ornate_Canopic_Jar_4407f6.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Warning Icon Red\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Warning_Icon_Red_1eeb32.png\" width=\"50\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">This article or section is about an event NPC, creature, item, object, outfit or location.</p><br/><p>The information about this NPC, <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">creature</a>, item, object, outfit or location is only relevant during a certain event or quest, e.g. only during Christmas.</p><p style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:x-small;\">Do not remove the information on this page because you can't find the NPC/creature/item/object/outfit/location.</p><p style=\"line-height:6pt;font-size:6pt;width:100%;text-align:right;\">discuss</p></div><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Ornate Canopic Jar</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Ornate Canopic Jar\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ornate_Canopic_Jar_4407f6.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Other Objects<br/>Quest Objects</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 6, 2011<br/>Summer Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Event</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20110806193648&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ornate_Canopic_Jar_4407f6.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an ornate canopic jar.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Horestis%20Tomb\">Horestis Tomb</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It likely contains some visceral remains of <a href=\"#/wiki/Horestis\">Horestis</a>. Use it to try destroying it. If you succeed, it will turn into The Remains of a Canopic Jar (Horestis) and you will see the <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Explosion Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Explosion_Effect_3c82ff.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Explosion Effect. If you don't, you'll have to wait an hour for another chance and you will see the <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Death Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Death_Effect_2a2678.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Death Effect.<br/>\nIt looks the same as a Lapis-Crested Vase.\n</p><p><b>Tries to break, 63 trials.</b><br/><br/>\n</p>\n<table class=\"loot_list sortable tw-cmd\" data-command=\"update-stats\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Item<br/></th>\n<th>Amount<br/></th>\n<th>Percentage<br/></th>\n<th>Tries to get 1<br/></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Success</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"> 0</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">0%</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">∞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fail</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"> 63</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">100%</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>It must be destroyed in the <a href=\"#/quest/the-mummys-curse-world-change\">The Mummy's Curse World Change</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Attack Effects</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Canopic%20Jar\">Canopic Jar</a></li><li>Constructions</li><li>Death Effect</li><li>Explosion Effect</li><li>Fearless</li><li>Hammer of Mighty Cheating</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Horestis\">Horestis</a></li><li>Lapis-Crested Vase</li><li>Other Objects</li><li>Repeatable Tasks</li><li>Statues</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-mummys-curse-world-change\">The Mummy's Curse World Change</a></li><li>The Remains of a Canopic Jar</li><li>The Remains of a Canopic Jar (Horestis)</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["the-mummys-curse-world-change"]}